avatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/yaml","state":"uploaded","size":389,"digest":"sha256:833f6de5250b8135bef617640d63f2a64235b836ec6178863bf27f57b3dcfe3b","download_count":23,"created_at":"2026-10-19T06:33:04Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T06:33:04Z"},{"id":655455072,"node_id":"RA_kwDOR_sfj84nEXNg","name":"latest-linux.yml","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/yaml","state":"uploaded","size":391,"digest":"sha256:7ba7f6ffe17aafcb4ca2d8fff3045242f0c9cd7283ac3b27664677564c6c8154","download_count":82,"created_at":"2026-10-19T06:36:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T06:36:07Z"},{"id":655473497,"node_id":"RA_kwDOR_sfj84nEbtZ","name":"latest-mac.yml","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/yaml","state":"uploaded","size":827,"digest":"sha256:aa5e7ddefe55b3891077e70e01f7b29e991a3e649b7fd086a3fc0a1d98b9caa1","download_count":1019,"created_at":"2026-10-19T06:45:46Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T06:45:46Z"},{"id":655454401,"node_id":"RA_kwDOR_sfj84nEXDB","name":"latest.yml","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/yaml","state":"uploaded","size":350,"digest":"sha256:49b8792474c079a27c2813956dc5ff75c115409fd622ee1abda1a951cc694132","download_count":2820,"created_at":"2026-10-19T06:35:48Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T06:35:49Z"}],"body":"## 更新重点\n\n- 新增账号级模型 API，可通过 OpenAI Responses API 调用可用模型，管理专用密钥并单独统计外部用量 (#3433)\n- 桌面端 Ekko 新增 Computer Use，支持查看和操作本机应用，并提供 macOS 权限指引及授权提醒 (#3411、#3427)\n- 单聊和群聊支持多选消息复制与删除，保护进行中的任务和群聊摘要，并简化消息操作工具栏 (#3422、#3423、#3425)\n- 聊天、群聊和工作流侧栏支持拖拽调整宽度，并限制最小和最大尺寸 (#3408)\n- 编程 Agent 的接口模式跟随 Provider 配置，修复 Responses 推理强度传递和跨模型思考历史兼容性 (#3430、#3416、#3432)\n- 修复聊天停止、队列撤回、工具审批结果和群聊计划鉴权，避免并发会话误显示其他会话的工作区改动 (#3404、#3409、#3414、#3415)\n- 修复桌面端 Electron 环境中的 Node 代码执行模式 (#3412)\n- 清除 Claude OAuth 登录时同步移除各 Profile 管理的凭据，避免残留登录状态 (#3442)\n- 新增 Windows ARM64 桌面安装包构建支持 (#3428)\n- 修复 TOS 7 全新安装、入口路径和服务重启策略，减少对主机环境及预建用户的依赖 (#3413、#3431)\n- Studio 与桌面端版本同步更新为 `0.7.37`，前端更新日志覆盖 12 种语言并保留最近三个版本 (#3445)。\n\n\n## What's Changed\n* [codex] make Studio sidebars resizable within width limits by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3408\n* [codex] fix expired-token failures in Hermes group task plans by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3409\n* [codex] fix verified access-control, runtime and chat issues by @wtj-0527 in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3404\n* [codex] fix chat protocol, queue recall and workspace overlap regressions by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3414\n* [codex] add native desktop Computer Use to Ekko Agent by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3411\n* [codex] forward scoped reasoning effort to Responses upstreams by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3416\n* fix: run Node code_exec children in Node mode under Electron by @250100901 in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3412\n* fix: expose successful tool approval scope to the model by @250100901 in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3415\n* [codex] Add chat message multi-select deletion and native desktop menus by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3422\n* [codex] Add group chat multi-select deletion with summary protection by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3423\n* [codex] Simplify chat selection toolbars to neutral icons by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3425\n* [codex] fix TOS review C21 portal route and S05 restart policy by @wtj-0527 in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3413\n* [codex] fix macOS Computer Use Dock icon and add permission guidance by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3427\n* Add Windows ARM64 desktop packaging by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3428\n* Fix Ekko encrypted reasoning replay after model switches by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3432\n* [codex] fix TOS installation dependencies and service account creation by @wtj-0527 in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3431\n* [codex] derive coding agent API modes from Providers by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3430\n* [codex] expose account-wide model Responses API and settings by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3433\n* fix: clear all profile-managed Claude OAuth credentials by @wtj-0527 in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3442\n* [codex] prepare Studio 0.7.37 with localized changelog by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3445\n\n## New Contributors\n* @250100901 made their first contribution in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3412\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/compare/v0.7.36...v0.7.37","mentions_count":3}
